    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Mohammad Anwar Waqar, Chairman, Department of Biochemistry, Aga Khan Medical University, Karachi has an international reputation as a highly qualified biochemist. He has been actively involved in biochemical research for the last 26 years. He is a distinguished academician and teacher. He has served on various Committees of the Medical School of the Aga Khan University and is involved in aspects of curriculum design and teaching strategies relevant to a newly established medical college. He is a highly valued and distinguished member of the senior faculty and enjoys peer support at all levels at the Aga Khan University Medical Centre, Karachi.",
